      "coupling": ["semantic", "structural", "runtime_boundary"],
      "layer": "release_gate",
      "rationale": "BPM094-M11A-03 replaces immutable host transcript witnesses with current source, command, locale, artifact, and safety semantics. The release gate still fails closed on a removed deployment envelope, delivery proof, or safety boundary."
